# Video Tutorials Series

## Introduction Series

In [this series](https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLxX6dDf3Kge5A2IDxC-PTLhi4l6_5uw9E), we start with basic concepts of HiPhyEngine, going through all the main features of the HiPhyEngine. It will also teach you how to setup different material models.

It will be the series to get you started no matter which material model interests you!

## Cloth Series

[This series](https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLxX6dDf3Kge7cevohdWo6EPWEkq67Fhy8) is a deep dive into cloth workflow with HiPhyEngine. We will start with tailoring, to parameter tuning, and finally shotwork.

This series highlights the HiPhyEngine's capability of cleaning up animation mesh and generating intersection free simulation results.

## Deformable Series

[This series](https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLxX6dDf3Kge4RVE2TfTuouPDJ_vMJrwuP) will go through how to set up a deformable body simulation for a human character to achieve secondary motion for a running animation while cleaning up the self intersections.
